oken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le13ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Superlatives and Comparatives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use comparative adjectives to compare yourself to another person. </br>You use superlative adjectives to compare yourself or something to a group of people.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Some adjectives change to different words in the comparative and superlative form. </br>  With one-syllable words, you add <span class=\"strong\">-er</span> to the adjective to make the       comparative form. You add <span class=\"strong\">-est</span> to the adjective to make the         superlative form.</br>     With words of two or more syllables, you add the word <span class=\"italic\">more</span> before          the adjective or adverb in the comparative form. You add <span class=\"italic\">the most</span>      before the adjective or the adverb in the superlative form.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":9,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective or Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"better\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the best\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"worse\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the worst\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hard\\\"}\",\