ssary.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "engenn6le13ob11re6aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": 2, "type": "template_override"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 10, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le13ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le13ob11re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le13ob11re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn6le13ob11re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Hi Sally!  </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hi Vanessa! Did you read my articles about gender issues in <span class=\"italic\">Cambridge Life</span>?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, I'm reading the online version now. I've got to finish reading the last one.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What do you think?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, you bring up some interesting ideas. In my opinion, the most important issue you talk about is the wage gap.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Everyone is going to have to work together if we want to solve this problem.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn6le13ob11re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You're right. I also liked the article about who talks more. I thought women were more social, but sometimes men are more outgoing.   </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I learned a lot about the changing family, and how women with infants and toddlers are going back to work sooner than before.", "time": "22500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn6le13ob11re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, but eating habits in the family haven't changed that much. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're right. Women consistently spend more time in the kitchen than men.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: One day, that will change. It will be a sweet victory!  What are you going to write about next?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm not sure yet. I've got to think about it!", "time": "36900", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "text", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn6le13ob11re5aud01"}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "text", "id": 3, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn6le13ob11re6aud01"}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}